    "description": "<p><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Meet the Rimba! </span></span></p>\n<p><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our Rimba hat is more flared up and provides wider skin protection from the face to the mid shoulder area.<br>Perfect for a long day under the sun.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The inside of the hat is made of cotton with </span>brimnes<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> interiors for better support and humidity absorption. Two metal buttons allow you to play with your style and wear it on any occasion. </span><br></span></p>",
